        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Georgie Collins\n- Works: Ghostkeeper, Lonesome Dove: The Series\n- Concepts: Wendigo legend, Wendigo psychosis\n- Places: North America\n\nFacts:\n- The Wendigo legend is a legend of North America.\n- The plot of the film Ghostkeeper is inspired by the Wendigo legend of North America.\n- Psychiatrists have described Wendigo psychosis as a controversial modern medical term and a culture-bound syndrome associated with symptoms such as an intense craving for human flesh and a fear of becoming a cannibal.\n- Georgie Collins is known for her role in the 1981 cult horror film Ghostkeeper.\n- Georgie Collins also appeared in Lonesome Dove: The Series in 1995.",
